WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:19.583
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.584 --> 00:00:23.299
I am a mountain gorilla.

3
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.704
Gorillas are the biggest kind of apes.

4
00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:30.959
Where do you live?

5
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.378
We live in the mountains of Africa.

6
00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:39.257
Our home is the forest.

7
00:00:39.258 --> 00:00:42.374
Do you make sounds?

8
00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.171
We make many sounds.

9
00:00:45.172 --> 00:00:51.123
We hoot and roar when we're mad.

10
00:00:51.124 --> 00:00:58.914
We growl softly when we're happy.

11
00:00:58.915 --> 00:01:04.540
What do you eat?

12
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:12.179
We mostly eat plants and tree bark.

13
00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:19.542
We really like plants' stems, roots, and leaves.

14
00:01:19.543 --> 00:01:23.204
Do you have any enemies?

15
00:01:23.205 --> 00:01:27.939
People are our main enemy.

16
00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:32.210
They steal our land and hunt us.

17
00:01:32.211 --> 00:01:37.255
But some people try to protect us.

18
00:01:37.256 --> 00:01:40.377
Do you live alone?

19
00:01:40.378 --> 00:01:44.197
No, we live in groups.

20
00:01:44.198 --> 00:01:46.889
See the baby?

21
00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:51.472
Young gorillas love to play!

22
00:01:51.473 --> 00:01:54.898
Who's in charge?

23
00:01:54.899 --> 00:01:58.900
The big silverback is our boss.

24
00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.677
He's the oldest male.

25
00:02:01.678 --> 00:02:10.119
He tells us what to do.

26
00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:13.985
I hear the silverback calling me now.

27
00:02:13.986 --> 00:02:16.279
Good-bye!

28
00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:24.882
Good-bye, Mountain Gorilla!
